  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am fine. I was not driving.' -- She assures him she was not hurt.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "elena",
   "t": "Я в порядке, не я была за рулем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
